    "user_request_original": "Design a 30-layer defect-cavity multilayer coating on SiO2 (Lemarchand) substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence: 7 pairs of hfo2/SiO2 (Lemarchand) Bragg reflector, followed by one hfo2 cavity layer at half-wave optical thickness for 1550 nm, followed by 7 pairs of SiO2 (Lemarchand)/hfo2 Bragg reflector (reverse order for symmetry), totaling 30 layers. Optimize Bragg pair thicknesses for 400-700 nm reflection and cavity layer thickness for 1550 nm transmission resonance. Use measured refractive index data for hfo2 and SiO2 (Lemarchand) from the material catalog. Total layer count fixed at 30.",
    "normalized_request_english": "Design a symmetric defect-cavity filter on SiO2 substrate with air incidence. Sequence: 7 pairs HfO2/SiO2, one HfO2 half-wave cavity at 1550 nm, 7 pairs SiO2/HfO2. Optimize all layer thicknesses to maximize 400–700 nm reflection and 1550 nm transmission.",
